Section I: The Macro-to-Micro Causal Topology & Deterministic Failure Mechanics
To identify the root causes of systemic disruptions, market freezes, and regulatory failures, the market cannot be analyzed as disconnected institutions. It operates as a deterministic, four-layer causal pipeline where political and legislative actions at Layer 1 dictate technical margin shocks at Layer 3 and broker liquidations at Layer 4.



